# API (PHP)

This folder is the project document root for PHP handlers served by Caddy `php_fastcgi` on your linked `.sp` domain.

- Put scripts here (for example `api/contact.php` → `https://{{NAME}}.sp/api/contact.php`).
- Do not commit secrets. Load credentials from environment variables.
- Prefer JSON responses and escape any HTML you render (`htmlspecialchars`).
